All terms are in worker-equivalents per year. The minimum is dimensionally coherent, resolving the v0.2 flaw in which \min\{\text{workers/year},\Delta\lambda/\lambda,\$/\text{year},\text{persons/year},\text{firms/year}\} was undefined.

I.4 Leontief Bottleneck Interpretation

The binding constraint can be interpreted as a Leontief bottleneck: the reabsorption process requires all five inputs in fixed proportions at the rate A_{\min}. If any input falls short, the entire reabsorption process is constrained to that rate. This is the dual of the Leontief production function applied to the institutional reabsorption technology.

